sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Cliente (WhatsApp)
    participant WA as Meta Cloud API
    participant Webhook as Laravel Webhook Controller
    participant Queue as Redis / Worker Queue
    participant Engine as Conversation Engine (State Machine)
    participant GC as Google Calendar API
    participant DB as MySQL DB

    User->>WA: Envía mensaje "Quiero turno"
    WA->>Webhook: POST /api/v1/webhooks/whatsapp
    Webhook->>Queue: Dispatch ProcessWhatsAppMessageJob
    Webhook-->>WA: 200 OK (< 200ms)
    Queue->>Engine: Process Message
    Engine->>DB: Fetch/Create Conversation State
    Engine->>GC: Query FreeBusy Slots (OAuth)
    GC-->>Engine: Return Available Slots
    Engine->>DB: Update State to 'SELECTING_SLOT'
    Engine->>WA: Send Interactive List (Buttons with Slots)
    WA-->>User: Muestra Botones con Horarios

    User->>WA: Selecciona "Mañana 15:00 hs"
    WA->>Webhook: POST Webhook (Interactive Response)
    Webhook->>Queue: Dispatch Job
    Queue->>Engine: Process Slot Selection
    Engine->>GC: Create Event (Book Slot)
    GC-->>Engine: Event Created (ID, Link)
    Engine->>DB: Persist Booking & Reset State
    Engine->>WA: Send Confirmation Message
    WA-->>User: "¡Turno confirmado para mañana a las 15:00!"